  "bio": "Henna San Diego is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in geometric and tribal styles, renowned for her intricate designs and precise workmanship. Based in San Diego, United States, she is the lead henna artist in the region and is sought after for parties and weddings, with her exceptional talent highlighted in the South Asian Bridal Magazine. Her dedication to her craft ensures that each piece is a work of art, tailored to match the unique vision of her clients.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: San Diego, California, United States"
